  "text": "Great developers deserve great tools.\nAt Supermaven, our goal is to build useful tools using unique technology.\nDownload\n20,000+\nDevelopers using Supermaven\n3x\nFaster than other tools\n1 million\nToken context window\nAbout\nOur goal is to build useful tools using unique technology.\nRead more about our technology here\n\nSupermaven was founded by Jacob Jackson, who previously created Tabnine, the first product to use AI for code completion. We are a small team of engineers seeking to create the best tool to make developers' lives easier.\n\nWe believe that creating the best tool requires a combination of model development and careful product design. Our team is dedicated to building tools that are easy to learn, give consistent and predictable results, and are accessible to everyone.\n\nReach out\nWe'd love to hear from you.\nEmail us\nJoin our Discord\nPricing\nAbout\nBlog\nLogin\nDownload\nTry Supermaven for free\nDownload\nContact Us\nPrivacy Policy\nCode Policy\nTerms of Service\nLanguage Examples",
